00:21:20.960 --> 00:21:23.210
SANDEEP DINESH: So for me,
it was my first IoT project

00:21:23.210 --> 00:21:25.720
with Node.js So
using Johnny-Five,

00:21:25.720 --> 00:21:28.125
I think, it's a really
cool open source library.

00:21:28.125 --> 00:21:29.500
If you're a
JavaScript developer,

00:21:29.500 --> 00:21:32.290
and you want to mess with
IoT, you just literally

00:21:32.290 --> 00:21:33.820
plug in your
Arduino, and then you

00:21:33.820 --> 00:21:36.510
can write JavaScript code to
control your devices instead

00:21:36.510 --> 00:21:37.630
