00:21:47.210 --> 00:21:49.660
And you only have so much
room on those devices.

00:21:49.660 --> 00:21:51.340
But with Johnny-Five,
it was just

00:21:51.340 --> 00:21:55.309
so nice to write IoT
code in JavaScript.

00:21:55.309 --> 00:21:57.100
FRANCESC CAMPOY: Yeah,
