00:30:16.390 --> 00:30:18.310
platform, Cloud ML for short.

00:30:18.310 --> 00:30:20.907
And, basically, it allows
you to train models

00:30:20.907 --> 00:30:22.990
on the Google Cloud Platform
infrastructure, yeah.

00:30:22.990 --> 00:30:23.830
TIMOTHY JORDAN: And
that's, I think,

00:30:23.830 --> 00:30:26.450
